WEBVTT

00:07:29.333 --> 00:07:33.271
is that it enables you to see the stars in the heavens

00:07:33.271 --> 00:07:35.710
with amazing clarity.

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:39.896
Have a look.

00:07:39.896 --> 00:07:43.552
(Video) Narrator: Some 1,500 miles south of the tropics,

00:07:43.552 --> 00:07:45.237
between Chile and Bolivia,

00:07:45.237 --> 00:07:50.413
the Andes completely change.

00:07:50.413 --> 00:07:55.042
It's called the Altiplano, or "high plains" --

00:07:55.042 --> 00:07:58.925
a place of extremes

00:07:58.925 --> 00:08:02.614
and extreme contrasts.